## How Memory Works

Claude uses these Markdown files to remember context across sessions. At the start of a session, reference relevant memory files by name. At the end of every session, run `/wrap` and Claude will update the appropriate files with new learnings, decisions, and notes.

Memory files are plain text — you can edit them directly at any time.

