## Memory Files

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `user_profile.md` | Your background, working style, preferences, and goals. Claude uses this to personalize responses and recommendations. |
| `feedback_defaults.md` | Your default preferences for how Claude should review and give feedback — tone, depth, format, and focus areas. |

